# FraudShield AI - Frontend Environment Configuration
# ======================================================================
# OPTION 1: Automatic Default (No changes required)
# When opening http://<laptop-ip>:5173 on your mobile phone,
# Vite dev server automatically proxies /api calls to backend (port 8000).
# Leave VITE_API_BASE_URL commented out to use Vite's automatic proxy.
#
# OPTION 2: Direct Phone-to-Backend Connection
# If you want your phone to call FastAPI directly over your Wi-Fi network,
# uncomment and set your laptop's local IPv4 address below:
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://172.21.161.27:8000/api
